      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'Enjoy ghee the way it fits naturally into Indian meals, on roti, in dal or khichdi, in sensible amounts, roughly a teaspoon or two a day early on. Homemade or pure ghee is better than adulterated or vanaspati blends. There is no need to force down spoonfuls of ghee "for delivery." If you have gestational diabetes, high cholesterol, or your weight gain is faster than advised, it is worth checking your fat intake with your doctor or a dietitian.',
