      ], []),
      PregFaqPart(PregFaqSection.forYou, '', [
        'Rather than a single target, aim for steady gain, and let your doctor track your pattern at each visit against charts suited to Indian women. Focus on balanced, nourishing meals, dal, vegetables, whole grains and protein, rather than eating for two or, at the other extreme, dieting to limit gain, which is not advised in pregnancy. Both gaining too much and too little carry some risks, which is exactly why it is monitored gently over time.',
